title: EnterTheatre
---
What would you like to do?

<<if $playerClub == "Theatre">>
    -> Attend Theatre Rehearsal
        <<startPractice "Theatre">>
    -> Exit
<<else>>
    -> Join Theatre Club

        <<if $playerClub == "Wrestling">>
            You are already in the Wrestling club.
            Would you like to quit it to join the Theatre club?

            -> Yes
                <<joinClub "Theatre">>
                You have successfully joined the Theatre Club!

                <<if $clubAttended == false>>
                    Rehearsal is about to start, do you wish to attend?

                    -> Yes
                        <<startPractice "Theatre">>
                    -> No

                <<endif>>
            -> No

        <<elseif $playerClub == "Debate">>
            You are already in the Debate club.
            Would you like to quit it to join the Theatre club?

            -> Yes
                <<joinClub "Theatre">>
                You have successfully joined the Theatre Club!

                <<if $clubAttended == false>>
                    Rehearsal is about to start, do you wish to attend?

                    -> Yes
                        <<startPractice "Theatre">>
                    -> No

                <<endif>>
            -> No

        <<else>>
            <<joinClub "Theatre">>
            You have successfully joined the Theatre Club!

            <<if $clubAttended == false>>
                Rehearsal is about to start, do you wish to attend?

                -> Yes
                    <<startPractice "Theatre">>
                -> No
            <<endif>>

        <<endif>>
    -> Exit

<<endif>>
